# Docker (From Basics to Advanced)
## Basic Commands

| Image | Category | Default Port | Sample Run Command |
|-------|-----------|--------------|--------------------|
| nginx | Web server | 80 | docker run -d -p 8080:80 nginx |
| httpd | Web server (Apache) | 80 | docker run -d -p 8081:80 httpd |
| caddy | Web server (auto HTTPS) | 80 | docker run -d -p 8082:80 caddy |
| mysql | Database | 3306 | docker run -d -p 3306:3306 mysql |
| postgres | Database | 5432 | docker run -d -p 5432:5432 postgres |
| mongo | Database | 27017 | docker run -d -p 27017:27017 mongo |
| redis | In-memory store | 6379 | docker run -d -p 6379:6379 redis |
| jenkins | CI/CD tool | 8080 | docker run -d -p 8083:8080 jenkins/jenkins |
| sonarqube | Code quality tool | 9000 | docker run -d -p 9000:9000 sonarqube |
| rabbitmq | Message broker | 5672 / 15672 | docker run -d -p 5672:5672 -p 15672:15672 rabbitmq |
| ubuntu | Base OS | N/A | docker run -it ubuntu |
| python | Runtime | N/A | docker run -it python |
| node | Runtime | 3000 (typical app) | docker run -it -p 3000:3000 node |
